WEBVTT

00:01:29.808 --> 00:01:31.606
I did all that.

00:01:33.046 --> 00:01:37.176
Well, I had excellent grades
in all subjects.

00:01:37.176 --> 00:01:39.177
All except one.

00:01:39.717 --> 00:01:42.437
You guessed it: math.

00:01:43.097 --> 00:01:46.767
All these calculations,
formulas, multiplication;

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:48.969
I just couldn't get them right.

00:01:50.119 --> 00:01:54.679
After I finished college, I realized
I had no future in Akola,

00:01:55.139 --> 00:02:01.418
so I decided to do something almost
nobody in my town had ever done before: